ts off as bad but then  becomes good and she also kind of has  task master ability she has the  abilities to mimic people so she's  definitely going to be a treat for the  show and as i mentioned she's getting  her own spin-off series which is heavily  rumored to feature daredevil and fisk so  she's not going anywhere anytime soon  now we end with two pretty awesome  scenes clint and kate are in a car being  chased and shot at by some members of  the tracksuit mafia but hawkeye is still  trying to do the best he can to be a  mentor to kate so he's telling her that  some arrows are off limits definitely  not this one this one's too dangerous  until he eventually does give her an  arrow in which she looks a lot like  taskmaster shooting and the arrow  actually looks like one that taskmaster  used as well because she shoots it and  the car behind her immediately explodes  she asks hawkeye there are arrows more  dangerous than that one and he kind of  just smirks it off as we've seen  throughout time in the mcu hawkeye has a  lot of different arrows and some of them  actually are pretty cool and very  dangerous unfortunately kate bishop  isn't going to be as cool as hawkeye  until she can shoot without even looking  at what she's shooting at but don't  worry because hawkeye is going to be  teaching her that the very last scene  that we get is of kate and clint jumping  off of a bridge safely into water and it  looks like hawkeye is trying to teach  kate his classic jump off of a building  turn around while grabbing an arrow and  shoot while falling move considering the  fact that it doesn't look like they're  being shot at and there's water behind  them it looks like this most likely is  clint teaching kate how to do that she's  probably studied him over time since she  looks up to him and she probably asked  him how to do that because she wants to  learn and if you look closely it doesn't  look like she's actually getting the  move down but i'm sure by the end of the  